Z||000000||x-thumpr-x||12-30-2001||10:52 AM||||I was just in High performance Magazine and they have a gallery (showroom)of pictures that owners have submitted. Lets see how many fiero owners we can get to send in pics of their beloved fiero(s).  Maybe they will get the hint on doing more issues with fiero's inside.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>ONE THING! if you are submitting from canada, it says you only need to put in the country  WRONG! I tried and it won't work. They keep asking for a state.  So, as a joke, their is now a place called  " Toronto ~Hawaii~  Canada"  makes you just think of nice warm weather we have up here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.mcmullenargus.com/gallery/templateA.asp?pub=23" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mcmullenargus.com/gallery/templateA.asp?pub=23</A> ||||reg||1
